OL,3,GNEWSAWar memorial next to sinking
OL,4,Aground investigated
OL,5,
OL,6,FA century-old war memorial next to
OL,7,F"sinking" ground is to be taken apart
OL,8,Ffor investigation work.
OL,10,FThe ground next to the 26ft (7.9m)
OL,11,Fstructure in Vivary Park, Taunton, has
OL,12,Fstarted to sink, said Somerset Council
OL,13,Fchair Mike Best, with the ongoing hot
OL,14,Fand dry conditions potentially damaging
OL,15,Fthe memorial.
OL,17,FThe monument was designed in 1922 to
OL,18,Fcommemorate more than 400 residents who
OL,19,Flost their lives or were reported
OL,20,Fmissing in World War One, and has since
OL,21,Fbecome the centre of the town's
OL,22,Fmemorial events.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
